Disclaimer of liability for use of public data
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

This skill consumes public data sources (BORME, datos.gob.es, Cartociudad,
PLACSP, AEPD, OpenStreetMap, DuckDuckGo). Users of this software are
responsible for:

  1. Compliance with each source's terms of service and rate limits.
  2. Compliance with GDPR Art. 6.1.f (legitimate interest) when storing
     personal data extracted from BORME (administrators' names are public
     by law but their use is regulated).
  3. Compliance with LSSI-CE Art. 21 BEFORE any commercial outreach: a
     prior business relationship or explicit consent is required for
     commercial electronic communications, even B2B.
  4. Maintaining a documented Legitimate Interest Assessment (LIA) and a
     Records of Processing Activities (ROPA) per GDPR Art. 30.
  5. Honoring opt-out requests within 10 days.

The authors disclaim all responsibility for misuse of this software for
spam, mass cold outreach without consent, or any activity that violates
GDPR, LSSI-CE, or the terms of service of the data sources consumed.
